ar/llm/plan_review/criteria_routing.json`, but effective routing (packaged overlay + `.rebar/criteria_routing.json`) is ALREADY bound into the signed `regver` stamp — which ADR 0053 deliberately GRANDFATHERS as non-blocking `registry_drift` at the claim gate. Adding these paths as blast-radius dep entries would make routing drift INVALIDATE no-file_impact attestations, re-litigating a dimension the codebase intentionally made non-blocking, via a second overlapping mechanism.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2fc43f0e136b08e3","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Section (b), 'Blast-radius entries' list","norm_id":"n89f8181350d117f8","priority":0.67,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":[],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"medium","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"moderate","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["A1"],"decision":"advisory","drop_reason":null,"evidence":[],"finding":"The blast-radius glob list hardcodes `.rebar/criteria_routing.json` and `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/criteria_routing.json`, but bot